# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern

# fern-csharp-sdk builds the csproj property by property and has no code path for
# <Description> or <Authors> (see getPropertyGroups in generators/csharp/base/src/project/
# CsharpProject.ts - it emits only Version, PackageReadmeFile, the license, PackageProjectUrl
# and PolySharp). No generators.yml key can supply them, so they live in Custom.props, which
# the generated csproj already imports conditionally.
#
# This entry is load-bearing: the generator unconditionally rewrites Custom.props from its
# stub template on every run, so without it these properties silently revert and the package
# goes back to showing MSBuild's default "Package Description" on nuget.org.
src/AwardSpring.Net/AwardSpring.Net.Custom.props
